  "reading": {
   "title": "Hafsa's first day at the cafeteria",
   "text": "It is Hafsa's first day at the school cafeteria. Mr. Brown introduces her to the team. There are four people: Ms. Davis, the manager, and three coworkers, Rosa, Ben and Kim.\n\nAt the break, Rosa asks Hafsa a lot of questions. \"Do you live near the school? Does your son go here?\" Hafsa answers, \"Yes, I do. Yes, he does.\" Ben asks, \"Do you speak Spanish?\" Hafsa laughs. \"No, I don't. I speak Turkish.\" Kim asks, \"Does Turkish food use a lot of rice?\" \"Yes, it does,\" says Hafsa.\n\nHafsa is a little shy, but her coworkers are nice. Ben has a hobby: he plays guitar. Rosa shares her favorite cookies with everyone. At the end of the day, Hafsa thinks, \"Do I like my new job? Yes, I do!\"",
   "glossary": [
